#: colorscm.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<h1>Colors</h1> This module allows you to choose the color scheme used for the "
"KDE desktop. The different elements of the desktop, such as title bars, menu "
"text, etc., are called \"widgets\". You can choose the widget whose color you "
"want to change by selecting it from a list, or by clicking on a graphical "
"representation of the desktop.<p> You can save color settings as complete color "
"schemes, which can also be modified or deleted. KDE comes with several "
"predefined color schemes on which you can base your own.<p> "
"All KDE applications will obey the selected color scheme. Non-KDE applications "
"may also obey some or all of the color settings, if this option is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: colorscm.cpp:132
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the color settings which will be applied if you click "
"\"Apply\" or \"OK\". You can click on different parts of this preview image. "
"The widget name in the \"Widget color\" box will change to reflect the part of "
"the preview image you clicked."
msgstr ""
"To je přehladka barbow, kiž so wužiwaja, hdyž kliknjeće \"wužić\" abo \"ok\". "
"Móžeće na wšelake dźěle wobraza kliknyć. Mjeno woknoweho elementa w kašćiku "
"\"barba woknoweho elementa\" pokazuje, na kotry dźěl wobraza sće kliknyli."

#: colorscm.cpp:144
msgid "Color Scheme"
msgstr "Barbny šema"

#: colorscm.cpp:153
msgid ""
"This is a list of predefined color schemes, including any that you may have "
"created. You can preview an existing color scheme by selecting it from the "
"list. The current scheme will be replaced by the selected color scheme.<p> "
"Warning: if you have not yet applied any changes you may have made to the "
"current scheme, those changes will be lost if you select another color scheme."
msgstr ""
"To je lisćina předefinowanych barbnych šemow, tež wšěch, kiž sće snadź sami "
"definowali. Móžeće sej přehladku wobhladać a tuchwilny šema z wubranym "
"narunać.<p> Kedźbu: Jeli šema změniće a njetłóčiće na \"wužić\", prjedy hač "
"druhi šema wubjerjeće, su waše změny zhubjene."

#: colorscm.cpp:161
msgid "&Save Scheme..."
msgstr "Šema &zawěsćić..."

#: colorscm.cpp:164
msgid ""
"Press this button if you want to save the current color settings as a color "
"scheme. You will be prompted for a name."
msgstr ""
"Stłóčće tutón knefl, jeli chceće tuchwilnu zestawu barbow jako barbny šema "
"zawěsćić. Program so was za mjenom wopraša."

#: colorscm.cpp:168
msgid "R&emove Scheme"
msgstr "Šemu &zničić"

#: colorscm.cpp:172
msgid ""
"Press this button to remove the selected color scheme. Note that this button is "
"disabled if you do not have permission to delete the color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Stłóčće tutón knefl za zničenje wubraneho šema. Tutón knefl hodźi so jenož "
"tłóčić, jeli maće prawo šemu zničić."

#: colorscm.cpp:176
msgid "I&mport Scheme..."
msgstr "Šemu &importować..."

#: colorscm.cpp:179
msgid ""
"Press this button to import a new color scheme. Note that the color scheme will "
"only be available for the current user."
msgstr ""

